* simple gain stage, testing out default params of the BSIM SOI model, 
* version 3.2

M1 3 2 0 0 nmos w=4u l=1u 
Rsource 1 2 100k
Rload 3 vdd 25k

Vdd1 vdd 0 5 
Vin 1 0 sin(1.44 0.1 1e+8 0 0)

.tran 1e-9 1e-7

.model nmos nmos level=10

.print TRAN format=csv file=output.csv precision=17 I(vdd1) I(vin) V(1) V(2) V(3) V(m1#body) V(vdd)
.end
